# Treat media as binary so git never tries to diff or normalise it.
*.jpg   -text
*.jpeg  -text
*.png   -text
*.webp  -text
*.avif  -text
*.gif   -text
*.ico   -text
*.mp4   -text
*.mov   -text
*.webm  -text
*.pdf   -text
*.woff  -text
*.woff2 -text

# Big video in git history is painful. Two better options, in order:
#   1. Keep video off the repo entirely (CDN / bucket) — see docs/MEDIA.md.
#   2. If it must be versioned, enable Git LFS and uncomment:
# *.mp4  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.mov  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.webm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
